#: admin/modules/ga41/ga4-shared-fields.php:547
msgid "By default, Google Analytics takes page titles from the \"title\" meta tag. This is not perfect since this tag can often change (e.g. when you tweak it with an SEO plugin). The result is that your Google Analytics can show you reports where one page can have multiple entries - under different titles."
